/S /P
/E (Defining boundaries for AI use within your organisation leads to better operational direction. The process involves determining which business sectors rely on AI, which systems will be integrated into AIMS, and which operations will remain outside of it. organisations achieve resource distribution effectiveness through boundary establishment, which also helps maintain consistent employee expectations across the entire organisation.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [14]
